  "title": "Brownie Pie",
  "description": "This brownie pie is rich and fudgy with a perfectly crisp crust. The perfect cross between brownies and pie so you don&#39;t have to choose!",
  "authors": [
    "Elizabeth Mervosh"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-09-30T11:42:57-04:00",
